# Thank you Melina!

We would just like to say a huge thank you to Melina for taking our dance class in October. She has done a brilliant job and has been such a great support since Bec had come down with pneumonia.  Mel starting dancing here with us when the dance class was running as a community dance coop. This was way back when we were trying to work out which direction to run the warm ups! We are so excited about the dance class now with a solid group of drummers to get our bodies moving quickly. Thanks to everyone that has helped us build this awesome pumping class to what it is today! [![Thank you Melina](/media/2015/11/RC-cotton-tree-world-fest-2015-23.jpg)](/media/2015/11/RC-cotton-tree-world-fest-2015-23.jpg)
